  "tip": "This unit is a fast check of Sections 1 and 2. If something feels new, go back to that unit, then come on.\n\n**Present simple** (habits, facts): আমি **করি** · তুই **করিস** · তুমি **করো** · সে **করে** · আপনি / উনি **করেন**.\n\n**Present continuous** (right now, these days): add **-ছ-**: আমি **করছি**, তুমি **করছো**, সে **করছে**, আপনি **করছেন**. Some stems change: খা → **খাচ্ছি**, যা → **যাচ্ছি**.\n\nNegative: **না** after the verb: **আমি মাছ খাই না**.\n\nFrom here on, lessons show Bengali script only; tap **Show pronunciation** when you need it.",
